     _n_a_m_e is the name of the error table.

     If a thread-safe version of the library is needed
     iinniittiiaalliizzee__<<nnaammee>>__eerrrroorr__ttaabbllee__rr() that internally calls
     iinniittiiaalliizzee__eerrrroorr__ttaabbllee__rr() instead be used.

     Any variable which is to contain an error code should be declared
